The engine analyzes all `<table>` elements and numeric cells:

> **Vertical Border Ink:** `I_vert = 0` (no interior vertical gridlines)
> **Numeric Cell Alignment:** `text-align: right` and `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`
> **Mobile Column Constraints:** `W_col >= 56px` or explicit horizontal scroll container (`.table-scroll`)

